   {"mm": [111.2, 361.6, 218.9, 368.6], "text": "SA1L058 REGULATOR ASSEMBLY"},
   {"mm": [42.3, 333.6, 286.3, 343.5], "text": "The constant current source Q2 isolates the incremental changes of the unregulated"},
   {"mm": [43.2, 328.0, 177.0, 336.6], "text": "dc input voltage from the control current lea"},
