   {"mm": [43.2, 322.3, 88.5, 329.3], "text": "the basc of Q3."},
   {"mm": [43.2, 308.7, 89.8, 316.4], "text": "Q3 is 1 current"},
   {"mm": [90.7, 307.4, 286.7, 317.0], "text": "amplifier designed to drive the series pass power transistor QL on"},
   {"mm": [43.2, 301.8, 183.9, 310.5], "text": "the main frame assembly of the M648 or M648A."},
   {"mm": [43.2, 289.3, 60.5, 296.3], "text": "Q4 is"},
   {"mm": [67.4, 288.0, 285.4, 296.6], "text": "level shifter which shifts the output voltage from the regulator Ul from"},
   {"mm": [43.2, 282.8, 107.3, 289.8], "text": "+24 volts to +48 volts."},
   {"mm": [43.2, 269.9, 121.8, 276.8], "text": "UI contains nominal 1.7"},
   {"mm": [123.5, 268.6, 286.5, 277.0], "text": "volt precision reference and comparison amplifier. The"},
   {"mm": [42.3, 261.5, 286.5, 270.5], "text": "comparison  voltage appearing at pin 6 of UI is derived from the sampling voltage"},
   {"mm": [42.5, 255.2, 285.9, 264.1], "text": "divider consisting of R13, Rl4 and RS. Adjustment of Rl4 is used to set the output"},
   {"mm": [42.5, 248.7, 125.7, 257.6], "text": "voltage to exactly +48 volts_"},
   {"mm": [128.5, 248.3, 286.3, 257.1], "text": "Ul derives its supply voltage from the +48 volt regu-"},
   {"mm": [42.5, 242.0, 276.1, 250.7], "text": "lated output via voltage divider R8 and R9, appearing at pins 2 and 3 of the IC."},
   {"mm": [43.0, 228.6, 280.9, 238.2], "text": "The sampling voltage divider Rl3 through to RlS may be effectively extended to"},
   {"mm": [93.9, 222.2, 243.8, 231.0], "text": "the sensing  voltage terminals at pins 9 and of"},
   {"mm": [43.0, 224.3, 63.5, 229.6], "text": "remote"},
   {"mm": [65.2, 223.5, 91.8, 230.6], "text": "load via"},
   {"mm": [245.9, 222.8, 285.9, 230.0], "text": "the SA14-058"},
   {"mm": [42.5, 217.0, 109.7, 223.9], "text": "assembly. This remote"},
   {"mm": [111.4, 215.9, 175.3, 224.5], "text": "sensing feature to"},
   {"mm": [160.0, 217.2, 166.5, 222.7], "text": "is"},
   {"mm": [177.9, 216.3, 247.0, 223.3], "text": "maintain constant load"},
   {"mm": [249.4, 215.7, 286.1, 223.6], "text": "voltages for"},
